1
00:00:07,774 --> 00:00:08,864
It's cold!

2
00:00:12,944 --> 00:00:15,604
Wow! Did you see that, Ioryogi-san?

3
00:00:15,814 --> 00:00:17,574
Huh? See what?

4
00:00:18,344 --> 00:00:20,174
Here it goes again.

5
00:00:26,694 --> 00:00:28,894
There! Isn't that something?!

6
00:00:28,894 --> 00:00:30,354
I guess it's winter...

7
00:00:33,994 --> 00:00:36,264
Look! Look how big!

8
00:00:42,634 --> 00:00:44,404
It really is the dead of winter, isn't it?

9
00:00:44,604 --> 00:00:47,094
How was that? Heat you up a bit?

10
00:00:47,444 --> 00:00:49,504
You're horrible.

11
00:00:51,414 --> 00:00:52,644
Wow!

12
00:00:58,684 --> 00:01:01,824
Kobato.

13
00:01:01,824 --> 00:01:04,664
Kobato.
Dou sureba iin dakke?

14
00:01:04,664 --> 00:01:09,064
Kobato.
Atarimae no kototte itsumo

15
00:01:09,964 --> 00:01:13,264
Muzukashii na

16
00:01:13,264 --> 00:01:16,034
Ureshii toki waratte

17
00:01:16,034 --> 00:01:20,334
Suki na toki ni utaitai dake

18
00:01:20,914 --> 00:01:23,344
Na no ni

19
00:01:24,644 --> 00:01:29,014
Itsuka negai wa kanau to

20
00:01:29,454 --> 00:01:32,724
Demo "itsuka" tte dore kurai?

21
00:01:32,724 --> 00:01:36,214
Machikirenai yo

22
00:01:36,354 --> 00:01:42,134
123! no aizu de ryoute hirogete

23
00:01:42,134 --> 00:01:47,334
Zenshin ni hikari wo atsumete

24
00:01:47,334 --> 00:01:50,174
Doko ni aru no?

25
00:01:50,174 --> 00:01:53,514
Oshiete, watashi ni dekiru koto

26
00:01:53,514 --> 00:01:56,344
Meippai kizu tsuite

27
00:01:56,344 --> 00:01:59,244
Seiippai hashitte

28
00:01:59,244 --> 00:02:03,214
Nan juu kai koronde naite

29
00:02:03,214 --> 00:02:06,254
Sore de mo mada

30
00:02:06,254 --> 00:02:10,284
Akireru kurai

31
00:02:10,764 --> 00:02:14,924
Ashita wo shinjiteru

32
00:02:24,674 --> 00:02:30,164
...Warmth of the Wintry Wind.

33
00:02:40,354 --> 00:02:41,754
Hey Kobato.

34
00:02:41,854 --> 00:02:44,084
What is it, Ioryogi-san?

35
00:02:44,324 --> 00:02:46,294
What comes after winter?

36
00:02:47,864 --> 00:02:48,834
Spring.

37
00:02:48,834 --> 00:02:53,134
Exactly. There isn't much time
before spring. You know that?

38
00:02:54,504 --> 00:02:57,944
You have got to fill this bottle
with kompeito by spring.

39
00:02:59,544 --> 00:03:00,634
Yes.

40
00:03:03,584 --> 00:03:07,104
But if you don't hurry,
you are not going anywhere!

41
00:03:09,854 --> 00:03:11,214
Yes.

42
00:03:12,484 --> 00:03:15,854
So I woke up this morning and my Dad?

43
00:03:15,854 --> 00:03:17,654
He was sleeping with his stomach uncovered.

44
00:03:17,864 --> 00:03:21,194
You're kidding. Well let me tell
you what my brother...

45
00:03:23,234 --> 00:03:24,564
What's the matter?

46
00:03:24,734 --> 00:03:27,864
That man. He's here today, too.

47
00:03:31,104 --> 00:03:32,264
Come along.

48
00:03:38,144 --> 00:03:39,914
Honey, let's stay home today.

49
00:03:39,914 --> 00:03:41,114
Mommy?

50
00:03:45,984 --> 00:03:48,424
Hey. I'm going to call the police.

51
00:03:48,854 --> 00:03:50,984
I haven't stepped one foot in.

52
00:03:51,464 --> 00:03:53,754
You have nothing to complain about.

53
00:03:54,434 --> 00:03:55,984
This is harassment.

54
00:03:56,464 --> 00:03:58,124
I'm just standing here.

55
00:04:01,334 --> 00:04:05,744
This kindergarten isn't really a safe
place to leave your kids, is it?

56
00:04:08,314 --> 00:04:09,714
Fujimoto?

57
00:04:13,514 --> 00:04:14,944
This guy...

58
00:04:18,984 --> 00:04:21,014
It's that debt collector from the other day.

59
00:04:21,224 --> 00:04:22,284
Let's go.

60
00:04:24,164 --> 00:04:25,354
But...

61
00:04:25,824 --> 00:04:27,024
Leave him.

62
00:04:48,014 --> 00:04:50,244
Hello. Yomogi Kindergarten.

63
00:04:51,154 --> 00:04:53,674
Oh, Rikako's Mom.

64
00:04:54,054 --> 00:04:56,894
I was worried because Rikako didn't come today.

65
00:05:00,164 --> 00:05:02,424
So... does that mean?

66
00:05:05,664 --> 00:05:10,974
I understand. I'll be waiting
for the forms in the mail.

67
00:05:12,274 --> 00:05:16,174
Yes. Yes. That will be fine.

68
00:05:18,014 --> 00:05:22,674
Well then, please tell Rikako to stay well.

69
00:05:27,154 --> 00:05:30,024
Rikako has quit kindergarten.

70
00:05:30,194 --> 00:05:31,384
Huh?!

71
00:05:33,394 --> 00:05:35,454
That's three...

72
00:05:36,694 --> 00:05:38,564
...this month, already.

73
00:05:43,404 --> 00:05:47,034
But the way things are I can't really
blame the parents for worrying.

74
00:05:56,984 --> 00:05:58,974
Huh? Of course that won't do!

75
00:05:59,624 --> 00:06:03,784
You deal with it yourself! Huh? Huh?!

76
00:06:08,534 --> 00:06:12,294
Great! There's so much!

77
00:06:12,764 --> 00:06:14,564
Thank you, Domoto.

78
00:06:14,704 --> 00:06:20,074
No problem. It's just stuff lying around at
home or left over from the school festival.

79
00:06:20,544 --> 00:06:24,174
It's a great help. We'll be able to
have a fun Christmas party.

80
00:06:29,614 --> 00:06:30,774
Ms. Sayaka.

81
00:06:31,084 --> 00:06:32,114
Yes?

82
00:06:32,524 --> 00:06:34,514
Please don't work yourself too hard.

83
00:06:36,454 --> 00:06:37,944
I'll be all right.

84
00:06:38,564 --> 00:06:39,584
Um...

85
00:06:40,664 --> 00:06:43,184
If you're looking for Fujimoto and Kobato,
they're up on the roof.

86
00:06:44,634 --> 00:06:45,694
Thanks.

87
00:06:51,074 --> 00:06:54,474
Ms. Sayaka seemed sad to let her go.

88
00:06:55,844 --> 00:06:59,744
Of course she was the same,
kind Ms. Sayaka we know.

89
00:07:02,814 --> 00:07:04,684
But she seemed very sad.

90
00:07:06,784 --> 00:07:07,914
Yeah.

91
00:07:09,494 --> 00:07:10,924
That man...

92
00:07:11,494 --> 00:07:15,594
And that when the due date arrives,
I'm going to shut down the kindergarten.

93
00:07:15,794 --> 00:07:17,064
You can't do that!

94
00:07:17,334 --> 00:07:19,094
I don't care if children are attending.

95
00:07:19,734 --> 00:07:23,434
Tell her if she doesn't want anyone
injured, to pack her things and go.

96
00:07:25,644 --> 00:07:28,234
How can he be so mean?

97
00:07:29,714 --> 00:07:33,584
Mr. Okiura is Ms. Sayaka's husband, isn't he?

98
00:07:34,414 --> 00:07:36,044
He doesn't deserve being called that!

99
00:07:36,884 --> 00:07:38,284
I'm...

100
00:07:39,224 --> 00:07:42,194
I'm going to go and have a talk with that man!

101
00:07:42,754 --> 00:07:43,814
Huh?

102
00:07:44,924 --> 00:07:45,894
Don't go!

103
00:07:47,194 --> 00:07:51,034
But he's being a disturbance, right?

104
00:07:52,464 --> 00:07:54,694
He's not the type that will listen.

105
00:07:55,204 --> 00:07:58,834
If I talk to him properly,
I'm sure he'll understand.

106
00:08:00,814 --> 00:08:02,204
I'm telling you not to go down there!

107
00:08:02,514 --> 00:08:03,844
Why not?!

108
00:08:05,384 --> 00:08:07,544
Just listen to me. Don't you get involved!

109
00:08:08,054 --> 00:08:11,984
But if another child quits,
Ms. Sayaka will be so sad!

110
00:08:12,584 --> 00:08:15,024
That's not something you have to worry about!

111
00:08:16,294 --> 00:08:18,194
I'm telling you, don't do anything!

112
00:08:19,224 --> 00:08:20,214
But...

113
00:08:21,794 --> 00:08:23,194
Domoto?

114
00:08:23,594 --> 00:08:24,754
What's up?

115
00:08:32,004 --> 00:08:33,204
Is something the matter?

116
00:08:41,714 --> 00:08:45,714
That's three... this month already.

117
00:08:46,684 --> 00:08:50,624
But the way things are I can't really
blame the parents for worrying.

118
00:08:51,624 --> 00:08:53,094
I see...

119
00:08:53,164 --> 00:08:54,854
We've got to do something.

120
00:08:55,564 --> 00:08:59,004
If there was an easy solution,
Fujimoto would have found it long ago.

121
00:08:59,704 --> 00:09:02,074
I understand how you feel Kobato,
but really, you shouldn't.

122
00:09:02,074 --> 00:09:04,834
But I'm going to go and ask him.

123
00:09:05,074 --> 00:09:06,564
But...

124
00:09:06,774 --> 00:09:10,574
If we leave things alone, there will be
no more Yomogi Kindergarten.

125
00:09:11,184 --> 00:09:12,844
That will make everyone sad.

126
00:09:12,984 --> 00:09:17,044
So I'm going to go over and just talk to him.

127
00:09:22,694 --> 00:09:24,054
Kobato!

128
00:09:25,764 --> 00:09:26,954
Snow!

129
00:09:27,194 --> 00:09:28,994
Let's fill the place with snow!

130
00:09:29,494 --> 00:09:30,984
That would be pretty.

131
00:09:31,334 --> 00:09:32,864
Can we make it all white with snow?

132
00:09:32,864 --> 00:09:34,594
Teacher Kiyokazu!

133
00:09:35,574 --> 00:09:37,804
Let's decorate this together!

134
00:09:39,674 --> 00:09:40,674
Uh, sure...

135
00:09:40,674 --> 00:09:46,144
There are round ones around it, so we'll
add small balls and surround it.

136
00:09:46,144 --> 00:09:47,444
And then guess what?

137
00:09:53,454 --> 00:09:55,944
What is Dobato up to now?

138
00:10:06,534 --> 00:10:08,004
Who are you?

139
00:10:08,004 --> 00:10:09,574
I'm Kobato Hanato!

140
00:10:09,574 --> 00:10:10,834
Huh?

141
00:10:10,974 --> 00:10:13,104
It's a nice day today.

142
00:10:13,744 --> 00:10:15,114
Huh?

143
00:10:15,114 --> 00:10:20,014
If you hang your bedding out on days
like this it gets soft and warm.

144
00:10:20,684 --> 00:10:26,724
Play lots outside and have a nice nap in the soft
futon and say let's do it all again tomorrow.

145
00:10:26,724 --> 00:10:30,594
Because tomorrow, everybody will be back
at Yomogi Kindergarten again.

146
00:10:31,364 --> 00:10:33,414
What on earth are you talking about?

147
00:10:33,824 --> 00:10:35,794
We went on picnics too!

148
00:10:36,134 --> 00:10:38,104
We even made pictures with fallen leaves!

149
00:10:38,834 --> 00:10:45,064
Digging for sweet potatoes was fun! And lots of
people came to our bazaar the other day!

150
00:10:46,604 --> 00:10:51,104
You know what? This kindergarten is filled
with everybody's thoughts and feelings.

151
00:10:51,484 --> 00:10:55,074
It's full of it! So please!

152
00:10:56,214 --> 00:10:58,844
Please don't close Yomogi Kindergarten down!

153
00:10:59,424 --> 00:11:01,044
Please!

154
00:11:02,394 --> 00:11:04,824
Pay back the money before you talk like that.

155
00:11:04,994 --> 00:11:06,554
I understand that.

156
00:11:06,664 --> 00:11:08,824
So we'll pay it back a little bit at a time!

157
00:11:09,134 --> 00:11:11,824
Kobato. Talking to this man won't...

158
00:11:15,804 --> 00:11:17,364
Is something wrong?!

159
00:11:17,674 --> 00:11:19,534
It's none of your business.

160
00:11:19,844 --> 00:11:25,744
This guy is right. Talking to me
will not get you anywhere.

161
00:11:26,144 --> 00:11:29,144
Then I'll talk to Mr. Okiura.

162
00:11:29,654 --> 00:11:31,884
He's not going to listen to someone like you.

163
00:11:32,384 --> 00:11:33,544
Besides...

164
00:11:33,954 --> 00:11:38,854
The kindergarten is the last place his
old man is going to take pity on.

165
00:11:39,864 --> 00:11:41,054
His father?

166
00:11:42,094 --> 00:11:45,594
Well I'm leaving now, but I tell you, I'll be back.

167
00:11:45,964 --> 00:11:48,304
Please! Save Yomogi Kindergarten!

168
00:11:50,374 --> 00:11:51,464
See you!

169
00:11:51,904 --> 00:11:54,964
Kobato, let's just forget it for today.

170
00:11:55,844 --> 00:11:57,074
Okay.

171
00:12:02,284 --> 00:12:03,754
Are you all right?!

172
00:12:04,684 --> 00:12:06,214
Is your stomach hurting you?!

173
00:12:06,324 --> 00:12:07,814
Get away from me!

174
00:12:09,194 --> 00:12:10,154
But...

175
00:12:10,294 --> 00:12:13,194
Shut up! Just leave me alone!

176
00:12:17,034 --> 00:12:18,364
I cannot leave you alone!

177
00:12:23,704 --> 00:12:29,444
Are you going to be okay?
What's wrong?! Are you all right?!

178
00:12:37,354 --> 00:12:39,284
Hey, it's Kobato.

179
00:12:39,524 --> 00:12:41,454
Domoto's there too!

180
00:12:45,224 --> 00:12:47,324
He suddenly collapsed!

181
00:12:59,544 --> 00:13:02,234
Kobato went with them.

182
00:13:02,614 --> 00:13:03,974
Yeah...

183
00:13:32,074 --> 00:13:33,844
Ms. Sayaka!

184
00:13:33,844 --> 00:13:34,904
Hm?

185
00:13:35,544 --> 00:13:36,914
The ambulance.

186
00:13:36,914 --> 00:13:39,344
It went away sounding its siren, didn't it?

187
00:13:39,414 --> 00:13:40,434
Yes it did.

188
00:13:41,314 --> 00:13:42,284
Now.

189
00:13:42,784 --> 00:13:44,084
You get some sleep.

190
00:13:49,794 --> 00:13:52,024
Good afternoon, Yomogi Kindergarten.

191
00:13:53,294 --> 00:13:54,664
Appendicitis?

192
00:13:55,794 --> 00:13:56,764
Uh-huh.

193
00:13:57,604 --> 00:14:00,364
Okay. I'll tell Ms. Sayaka too.

194
00:14:31,064 --> 00:14:32,054
Kobato.

195
00:14:33,034 --> 00:14:34,664
The operation was successful.

196
00:14:35,274 --> 00:14:36,894
They say he's going to be okay now.

197
00:14:38,144 --> 00:14:39,574
Really?

198
00:14:39,844 --> 00:14:42,404
Really. No worries.

199
00:14:43,844 --> 00:14:45,214
Oh good.

200
00:14:45,914 --> 00:14:47,104
Shall we go then?

201
00:14:47,284 --> 00:14:48,584
Yes.

202
00:15:08,734 --> 00:15:09,994
Oh?

203
00:15:12,474 --> 00:15:14,164
I wonder what you're calling about.

204
00:15:14,914 --> 00:15:18,504
That guy you put in front of the kindergarten...

205
00:15:18,884 --> 00:15:20,914
He had appendicitis and collapsed.

206
00:15:20,914 --> 00:15:22,504
Appendicitis?

207
00:15:22,714 --> 00:15:24,654
He's at Central Hospital.

208
00:15:24,654 --> 00:15:26,674
The operation apparently went well.

209
00:15:27,184 --> 00:15:30,154
Is that right? Well, sorry for the trouble.

210
00:15:31,164 --> 00:15:33,324
Yeah. You're big trouble.

211
00:15:34,994 --> 00:15:37,224
Well then get off of that land.

212
00:15:37,334 --> 00:15:39,464
You have no way of paying me back.

213
00:15:41,704 --> 00:15:43,064
You understand?

214
00:15:43,604 --> 00:15:45,904
Is there any room for negotiation?

215
00:15:46,244 --> 00:15:47,534
Negotiation?

216
00:15:51,444 --> 00:15:52,884
What is so amusing?!

217
00:15:53,044 --> 00:15:55,884
What's with you? This isn't like you at all.

218
00:15:55,884 --> 00:15:58,474
Huh?! I'm asking you if it's possible!

219
00:15:58,954 --> 00:16:03,484
I'd say it's not. Thanks for
letting me know, anyway.

220
00:16:04,924 --> 00:16:06,994
Oh, and uh...

221
00:16:06,994 --> 00:16:08,124
What is it?

222
00:16:08,834 --> 00:16:12,924
Why don't you just give up and leave the
kindergarten, Fujimoto dear?

223
00:16:36,894 --> 00:16:39,654
Why did I call him?

224
00:16:40,094 --> 00:16:43,824
If I talk to him properly,
I'm sure he'll understand.

225
00:16:46,304 --> 00:16:47,364
We're back.

226
00:16:47,904 --> 00:16:48,834
Hey.

227
00:16:49,174 --> 00:16:52,104
Um. The gentleman was okay.

228
00:16:52,604 --> 00:16:54,704
They say he'll be fine soon.

229
00:16:55,774 --> 00:16:56,934
Is that right.

230
00:17:08,254 --> 00:17:09,954
Bye Kobato!

231
00:17:10,154 --> 00:17:12,024
Yes. Bye-bye!

232
00:17:14,664 --> 00:17:18,624
Mommy, you know what?
Rikako quit kindergarten.

233
00:17:18,964 --> 00:17:21,264
Really? Is that so?

234
00:17:26,574 --> 00:17:28,974
Kobato, you're free to go now.

235
00:17:29,314 --> 00:17:31,274
But there's still tidying to do.

236
00:17:31,744 --> 00:17:33,974
You've had a hard day.

237
00:17:34,384 --> 00:17:36,814
Go home and get some rest.

238
00:17:37,654 --> 00:17:41,584
We're going to get busy again with
Christmas decorating tomorrow. Okay?

239
00:17:42,394 --> 00:17:43,584
Okay.

240
00:17:45,224 --> 00:17:46,394
I'll walk you home.

241
00:17:46,394 --> 00:17:47,724
Domoto.

242
00:17:49,434 --> 00:17:51,164
Thanks for your help today.

243
00:17:51,304 --> 00:17:52,354
Don't mention it.

244
00:17:52,604 --> 00:17:54,334
I didn't really do anything.

245
00:17:55,304 --> 00:17:56,734
I'll go get my bag.

246
00:17:59,744 --> 00:18:02,174
Ioryogi-san, thank you for waiting.

247
00:18:02,344 --> 00:18:06,744
Look at this. No kompeitos today.
What are you going to do about it?

248
00:18:08,084 --> 00:18:12,614
But that man's going to be okay.
And that's good.

249
00:18:12,924 --> 00:18:18,384
How could that be good?! You know what he's
going to do once he gets better! You...

250
00:19:00,604 --> 00:19:01,804
What's wrong?

251
00:19:01,804 --> 00:19:05,294
Fujimoto was angry with me.

252
00:19:06,404 --> 00:19:09,864
He told me not to do anything and I...

253
00:19:11,114 --> 00:19:12,704
You did nothing wrong, Kobato.

254
00:19:13,084 --> 00:19:14,374
There's no reason to be concerned.

255
00:19:15,484 --> 00:19:16,814
But...

256
00:19:17,654 --> 00:19:18,774
Kobato?

257
00:19:19,854 --> 00:19:21,254
What do you say we sit down for a bit?

258
00:19:28,034 --> 00:19:30,154
What could be the best option?

259
00:19:32,034 --> 00:19:37,234
If Yomogi Kindergarten gets shut down,
everyone is going to be so unhappy.

260
00:19:38,944 --> 00:19:41,174
What is there that can I do?

261
00:19:43,314 --> 00:19:44,774
Kobato...

262
00:19:48,784 --> 00:19:52,274
You're always concerned about
the people around you.

263
00:19:55,224 --> 00:19:57,984
You are kind and straightforward.

264
00:19:58,864 --> 00:20:01,154
Kobato, you're always trying your best.

265
00:20:03,764 --> 00:20:05,024
Kobato.

266
00:20:09,874 --> 00:20:13,504
I like girls like you, Kobato.

267
00:20:16,874 --> 00:20:18,174
Domoto.

268
00:20:18,714 --> 00:20:20,304
Thank you very much!

269
00:20:21,984 --> 00:20:25,044
Thank you. I feel a bit better now.

270
00:20:30,624 --> 00:20:32,054
You're very welcome.

271
00:20:44,474 --> 00:20:45,544
Here.

272
00:20:45,544 --> 00:20:46,764
Oh...

273
00:20:48,344 --> 00:20:49,974
It's nice and warm.

274
00:21:42,834 --> 00:21:44,694
Thank you very much.

275
00:21:47,164 --> 00:21:48,534
Kobato.

276
00:21:48,534 --> 00:21:50,434
Yes? What is it?

277
00:21:52,474 --> 00:21:54,034
On Christmas Day...

278
00:21:57,214 --> 00:21:59,234
Would you like to...

279
00:22:04,724 --> 00:22:05,944
Fujimoto.

280
00:22:09,094 --> 00:22:10,584
Just getting home?

281
00:22:11,264 --> 00:22:12,484
Yeah.

282
00:22:12,594 --> 00:22:18,054
Oh. Let me know if you need anything
else for the Christmas party.

283
00:22:19,864 --> 00:22:21,094
Yeah.

284
00:22:26,174 --> 00:22:28,364
Thank you for the scarf.

285
00:22:28,844 --> 00:22:29,644
Sure.

286
00:22:29,644 --> 00:22:31,114
Well then, see you.

287
00:22:31,314 --> 00:22:32,434
Goodbye.

288
00:22:36,584 --> 00:22:37,844
See you.

289
00:22:38,584 --> 00:22:39,644
Yeah.

290
00:23:01,374 --> 00:23:09,014
Hito wa mina tonde mitai no ni

291
00:23:10,184 --> 00:23:16,284
Juuryoku ni damasareterunda

292
00:23:16,554 --> 00:23:24,394
Dare mo honto wa toberunda yo

293
00:23:26,634 --> 00:23:32,974
Ano ko ga anna ni kanashisou na no wa

294
00:23:34,004 --> 00:23:36,874
Jibun no kage wo

295
00:23:36,874 --> 00:23:44,014
Dokoka ni wasurete kichatta kara kamo

296
00:23:44,184 --> 00:23:46,714
Sore nara

297
00:23:46,884 --> 00:23:50,994
"Arigatou," tte kimi ni ietara

298
00:23:50,994 --> 00:23:54,864
"Arigatou," tte kimi ga waraeba

299
00:23:54,864 --> 00:24:02,204
Ittari kitari ureshiku naru

300
00:24:02,734 --> 00:24:06,974
Kimi ga shiawase ni naru

301
00:24:07,274 --> 00:24:11,514
Shinpai nante iranai yo

302
00:24:11,514 --> 00:24:15,604
Issho ni iru kara

303
00:24:17,384 --> 00:24:23,324
Ureshikuttemo namida ga deru nante

304
00:24:23,324 --> 00:24:26,094
Fushigi da

305
00:24:26,094 --> 00:24:29,064
Next episode
...White Christmas.
